ask "Which pull request or local diff should I review?" as @target

do Read @target and the code needed to understand the change.
    Review correctness, regressions, and test coverage as @review

if @review identifies blocking issues
    print Explain the blockers in @review, with file references and suggested fixes.
    print "Resolve the blockers before requesting approval."
    return

do Draft a reviewer summary from @target and @review.
    Include the changed behavior, risks, and verification gaps as @summary
print @summary
